L. Waskom, and S. Ghosh. 2011. “Nipype: A Flexible, Lightweight
and Extensible Neuroimaging Data Processing Framework in Python.” 
 Frontiers in Neuroinformatics 5: 13. https://doi.org/10.3389/fninf.2011.00013 .


