data .” NeuroImage 64 (1): 240–56. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2012.08.052 .


Tustison, N. J., B. B. Avants, P. A. Cook, Y. Zheng, A. Egan, P. A.
Yushkevich, and J. C. Gee. 2010. “N4ITK: Improved N3 Bias
Correction.” IEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging 29
(6): 1310–20. https://doi.org/10.1109/TMI.2010.2046908 .


